n\nI'm now meticulously verifying the output, paying close attention to character restrictions and formatting. I'm confirming removal of special characters such as hyphens and ampersands and reformatting numbers. I am checking the accuracy of the conversions and making final adjustments. This output is ready.\n\n\n**Confirming Character Consistency**\n\nI'm now methodically reviewing the text, focusing on bullet point symbols. Previously, I was focused on removing punctuation and table structures and rendering the correct symbol for bullets. I'm verifying that all bullets are rendered correctly with the bullet symbol (•) and verifying all spaces are correct in the final output and also ensuring the bold text is preserved.\n\n\n**Refining Extrusion Formatting**\n\nI'm focusing now on the extrusion part of the output, specifically applying the correct formatting as requested. I'm carefully replacing the bullet points with the bullet symbol, removing any punctuation, and ensuring that all spacing remains correct. I am focused on the formatting of the numbers and text in this section.\n\n\n"}
